### Parent Registration
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Parent",
  "email": "praful-test@example.com",
  "password": "Test@12345",
  "confirmPassword": "Test@123451"
}

### Login parent
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "hridhaan@test.com",
  "password": "Pradhaani@1"
}

### Protected endpoint - no token
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/protected-test

### Protected endpoint - with token
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/protected-test
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiI2YWIxZDI0ZGYwZGEzYzg5NDdhMjk3YWUiLCJyb2xlIjoiUEFSRU5UIiwiaWF0IjoxNzkwMDUwNjI0LCJleHAiOjE3OTAxMzcwMjR9.avmVR9Mldcbn0Nw9sOG_TqQEyvnL4Vu2zvL5u81xUB0

